        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@TheLeoP, while reading some unrelated parts of Neovim help, I noticed that there seems to be an automated way to make `setup_termbg_sync()` do nothing if Neovim is started not in compatible way. So I think guarding behind `vim.g.started_by_firenvim` should not be necessary anymore (at least it is not needed for Neovide and VS Code Neovim extension).",
